# DEV-ONLY TRUST ROOT — NOT A PRODUCTION TRUST ANCHOR
#
# This is a real, working Ed25519 public key, so the bootstrap verifier can be
# built and tested end to end (DEV-02). Its private half is derived from a
# published seed and is therefore known to everyone:
#
#   seed = sha256("glt-dev-only-2026")
#        = a315d1c30ece9a9df8e0ce22f070645b72291198020b610c9787c54b22fbc182
#
# A key whose private half is public is not a secret. That is deliberate: it is
# impossible to mistake this for a trust anchor, unlike a placeholder that
# merely looks unfinished.
#
# key_id: glt-dev-only-2026
# Rejected by trust/release-policy.yaml as a release trust root.
# Production setup replaces this file — see README.md.
-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----
MCowBQYDK2VwAyEAp6spzeAZ0iCoagmNxxqxfOepLlMJaD1gjCtEJUA1xWg=
-----END PUBLIC KEY-----
